  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XQCwnTu.png\" alt=\"HolyCube Revolution 標題\"></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3LaEOaa.png\" alt=\"特色\"></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Vanilla Create ++ 整合包。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">在這個整合包中，你會找到大量針對 Create 的擴充模組，以及一些 QoL 模組，例如 Sophisticated Backpack、Waystones、Journey Map。此外還有許多建築與裝飾模組，讓你成為最美麗的玩家！本整合包沒有任務書，盡情享受探索的樂趣，並盡可能利用 Create 6.0 進行自動化！！！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/F00cVdQ.png\" alt=\"推薦配置\" width=\"934\" height=\"168\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>此整合包不與 Optifine 相容！</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">最低配置記憶體：3GB</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">建議配置記憶體：4-6GB&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zQdzEoA.png\" alt=\"伺服器\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">如果你有興趣託管 Holycube Revolution 伺服器，請點擊下方圖片！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.nitroserv.com%252fen%252fhosting%252fminecraft%253fref%253dmrmldeg%2526utm_source%253dtwitch%2526utm_medium%253dmarketoche%2526utm_campaign%253dmrmldeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/K7ImhFL.png\" alt=\"Nitroserv 伺服器託管\" width=\"797\" height=\"104\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">輸入優惠碼 <strong>MrMLDEG</strong> 即可享有 <strong>20% 折扣</strong>，建議為本整合包至少選擇 6GB 記憶體的方案。&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/G6gnKgH.png\" alt=\"歷史沿革\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">這個整合包的背景故事很簡單：來自過往 Holycube 季節的 YouTuber 與串流主播 Aypierre 提出了製作一個以 Create 及其擴充模組和 QoL 模組為主題的季節的想法。像 Yassou 這樣的模組開發者志願為本整合包製作擴充模組，因此你能在這裡找到獨家內容，其他地方都找不到！（目前為止哈哈）</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OCC3MrI.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"934\" height=\"168\"></p>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-encased\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Encased (by iglee42)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API (Fabric/Forge/NeoForge) (by shedaniel)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/expanded-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Expanded Delight (by ianm1647)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-enchantment-industry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Enchantment Industry (by DragonsPlus)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/watermedia\" rel=\"nofollow\">WATERMeDIA: Multimedia API (by SrRapero720)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/konkrete\" rel=\"nofollow\">Konkrete [Forge/NeoForge] (by Keksuccino)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-professions-jep\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Professions (JEP) (by Mrbysco)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/display-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Display Delight (by jkvin114)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-villagers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Easy Villagers (by henkelmax)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/controlling\" rel=\"nofollow\">Controlling (by Jaredlll08)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/build-guide\" rel=\"nofollow\">Build Guide (by brentmaas)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-backups\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Backups (by MelanX)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fusion-connected-textures\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fusion (Connected Textures) (by SuperMartijn642)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bellsandwhistles\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Bells &amp; Whistles (by syslev)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/holycube-backport\" rel=\"nofollow\">Holycube Backport (by iglee42)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emotecraft-forge